<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hanbo Steel shares up on Hyundai news.</title>
<headline>Hanbo Steel shares up on Hyundai news.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in South Korea's Hanbo Steel Corp were eagerly bought in early Friday trading on Thursday's annoucement that the government was opposed to the construction of an additional steel mill, brokers said.</p>
<p>Hanbo shares topped the most-actives list after touching a high of 9,940 won at the opening bell. It later settled at 9,710 won, up 330.</p>
